    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Charles Otto Puth Jr. ( ) (born December 2, 1991) is an American singer, songwriter and record producer. He is known for his 2015 song \"See You Again\", which he wrote, co-produced, and performed with Wiz Khalifa for the \"Furious 7\" soundtrack as a tribute to Paul Walker.",
